{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37232","headline":"雨 · 章谒","name":"雨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"低着烟花漠漠轻，正堪吟坐掩柴扃。\n乱沾细网垂穷巷，斜送阴云入古厅。\n锁却暮愁终不散，添成春醉转难醒。\n霁来还有风流事，重染南山一遍青。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"章谒","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37232.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37232","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}